# KN-002: Stirring gives a bounded heterogeneous-catalyst rate enhancement
# Candidate experiment; expected observations are not measured results.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 MnO2 0.001mol
add v1 H2O2 0.001mol
new
add v2 water 100mL
add v2 MnO2 0.001mol
add v2 H2O2 0.001mol
stir v1 600rpm 5s
stir v2 1rpm 5s
inspect
